{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3b2c1a-7e4d-4b9a-a823-helpdesk2026",
    "name": "Helpdesk Enterprise Security API - Taller Auth & JWT",
    "description": "Colección completa de pruebas para el Taller Evaluativo de Autenticación Stateless y Control de Acceso RBAC con Spring Boot 4 y JJWT.\n\nIncluye scripts automáticos para almacenar los tokens JWT en variables de colección y probar la matriz de seguridad por roles.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cliente_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "soporte_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ticket_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00. Pruebas Iniciales (Código Base)",
      "description": "Peticiones para verificar el backend en el arranque inicial de src_base. Al incluir spring-boot-starter-security sin SecurityConfig.java, Spring Boot activa su formulario web por defecto (/login) y responde 401 Unauthorized. Una vez implementada la seguridad con JWT (Fases 1 a 5), estas rutas responderán 403 Forbidden para clientes no autorizados.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Listar Tickets (Sin Auth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets"]
            },
            "description": "Al inicio del taller sobre src_base responderá 401 Unauthorized (o el formulario web 'Please sign in' si se siguen redirecciones). Tras implementar SecurityConfig con Stateless JWT, responderá 403 Forbidden."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Crear Ticket (Sin Auth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"titulo\": \"Prueba inicial sin token\",\n    \"descripcion\": \"Verificación del backend en arranque inicial.\",\n    \"prioridad\": \"BAJA\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Auditoría Admin (Sin Auth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/auditoria",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auditoria"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01. Autenticación (Auth)",
      "description": "Endpoints públicos de registro y emisión de tokens JWT. Los scripts automáticos guardan el token recibido en las variables de la colección.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar Cliente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    let json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cliente_token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token de CLIENTE guardado correctamente.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"cliente_demo\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Registra un usuario con rol CLIENTE y guarda automáticamente su token en {{cliente_token}} y {{jwt_token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar Soporte",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    let json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('soporte_token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token de SOPORTE guardado en {{soporte_token}}.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"soporte_laura\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register-soporte",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register-soporte"]
            },
            "description": "Registra un técnico de soporte con rol SOPORTE y almacena el token en {{soporte_token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    let json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token de ADMIN guardado en {{admin_token}}.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"admin_root\",\n    \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register-admin",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register-admin"]
            },
            "description": "Registra un administrador con rol ADMIN y guarda el token en {{admin_token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login (Credenciales Válidas)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    let json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Login exitoso: token actualizado en {{jwt_token}}.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"cliente_demo\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Autentica credenciales y emite token JWT."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login (Credenciales Inválidas -> 401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"cliente_demo\",\n    \"password\": \"password_erroneo\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Prueba de autenticación fallida. Debe responder con HTTP 401 UNAUTHORIZED."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02. Gestión de Incidentes (Tickets)",
      "description": "Operaciones CRUD sobre tickets utilizando tokens Bearer.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Crear Ticket (Como CLIENTE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    let json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ticket_id', json.id);",
                  "    console.log('Ticket creado con ID:', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cliente_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"titulo\": \"Falla en portal corporativo de pagos\",\n    \"descripcion\": \"Error 500 al confirmar transacción con pasarela PSE.\",\n    \"prioridad\": \"ALTA\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un ticket autenticado como CLIENTE (o ADMIN). Retorna 201 Created y guarda el ID en {{ticket_id}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Listar Tickets (Como CLIENTE / SOPORTE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cliente_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets"]
            },
            "description": "Permitido para CLIENTE, SOPORTE y ADMIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Buscar Ticket por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cliente_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets", "{{ticket_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene los detalles del ticket con ID {{ticket_id}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT Actualizar Estado (Como SOPORTE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{soporte_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"estado\": \"EN_PROCESO\",\n    \"tecnicoAsignado\": \"soporte_laura\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/estado",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets", "{{ticket_id}}", "estado"]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza el estado a EN_PROCESO y asigna el técnico. Permitido para SOPORTE y ADMIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Eliminar Ticket (Como ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets", "{{ticket_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Elimina el ticket permanentemente. Exclusivo para ADMIN. Retorna 204 No Content."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03. Panel de Administración",
      "description": "Endpoints restringidos exclusivamente a administradores.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Auditoría del Sistema (Como ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/auditoria",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auditoria"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna métricas operacionales del sistema. Exclusivo para ADMIN."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04. Pruebas de RBAC y Control de Acceso (Matriz)",
      "description": "Peticiones para verificar que la seguridad bloquea accesos no autorizados con 403 Forbidden.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CLIENTE intenta Actualizar Estado -> 403 Forbidden",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cliente_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"estado\": \"RESUELTO\",\n    \"tecnicoAsignado\": \"cliente_infiltrado\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/estado",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets", "{{ticket_id}}", "estado"]
            },
            "description": "Debe ser bloqueado con 403 Forbidden porque los clientes no tienen permiso para modificar estados de tickets."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "CLIENTE intenta Eliminar Ticket -> 403 Forbidden",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cliente_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets", "{{ticket_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Debe ser bloqueado con 403 Forbidden porque solo ADMIN puede eliminar incidentes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SOPORTE intenta Eliminar Ticket -> 403 Forbidden",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{soporte_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tickets", "{{ticket_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Debe responder con 403 Forbidden porque SOPORTE no tiene privilegios de borrado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "CLIENTE intenta acceder a Auditoría ADMIN -> 403 Forbidden",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cliente_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/auditoria",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auditoria"]
            },
            "description": "Debe ser rechazado con 403 Forbidden al intentar acceder a rutas bajo /api/v1/admin/**."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
